WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Ken blocks Ryu's Drive Impact with his back to the corner.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.800
Ryu strikes the wall-splatted opponent with crouching heavy punch.

3
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.100
Ryu hits Ken with heavy High Blade Kick.

4
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.200
Ken is airborne after the Blade Kick as Ryu recovers at the corner.
